    {"german_text": 'Die Bürger protestieren gegen die Steuererhöhung.', "english_translation": 'The citizens protest against the tax increase.', "arabic_translation": 'المواطنون يحتجون ضد زيادة الضرائب.', "level": 'A2', "difficulty_score": 5, "category": 'Politics'},
